  <h2>Precision at Every Stage</h2>
  <p>Our process begins with professional <strong>Pattern Making</strong> and <strong>Cutting</strong>, utilizing CAD systems to minimize fabric waste. The assembly involves specialized <strong>Bartack Stitching</strong> and trimming to ensure reinforced seams that withstand high-intensity workouts.</p>
  
  <h2>Quality Control: The Needle Detection Step</h2>
  <p>One of the most critical steps for global retailers is Step 10: <strong>Needle Detection</strong>. We utilize industrial-grade sensors to ensure no metal fragments or broken needles remain in the garment—a safety standard required by premium international brands.</p>
  
  <p>By standardizing every touchpoint from design to final <strong>Shipping</strong>, we provide our partners with the reliability required for high-growth activewear business.</p>
